OL,3,AZack Polanski tells Kuenssberg he will
OL,4,Anot overturn Green Party's 'Zionism is
OL,5,Aracism' motion
OL,6,
OL,7,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski he
OL,8,Fwon't overturn the party's "Zionism is
OL,9,Fracism" motion
OL,11,FHe tells Sunday with Laura Kuenssberg
OL,12,Fhe wants to see it amended "at the
OL,13,Ffirst available opportunity" but that
OL,14,Fwon't be until at least 2028
OL,16,FThe motion defines Zionism as an
OL,17,Fideology supporting "an
OL,18,Fethnonationalist Jewish state" and
OL,19,Fbacks "a single democratic Palestinian
OL,20,Fstate in all of historic Palestine"
